  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.OrbitDBOASIS v2.0.3\n\nConnects the OASIS to OrbitDB via the orbit-db-http-api REST server. OrbitDB is a serverless, distributed, peer-to-peer database built on IPFS. Requires a running orbit-db-http-api server instance. No OrbitDB SDK required — uses System.Net.Http. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n- Prepare scoped GUN and OrbitDB native teaching release (c2dbac8)\n- Validate GUID native keys before avatar deletion in forty adapters (597758b)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Other/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.OrbitDBOASIS",
